57-luotong","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luotong:line061","quote":"駱統字公緒，會稽烏傷人也。父俊，官至陳相。為袁術所害。統母改適，為華歆小妻，統時八歲，遂與親客歸會稽。其母送之，拜辭上車，面而不顧，其母泣涕於後。御者曰：「夫人猶在也。」統曰：「不欲增母思，故不顧耳。」事適母甚謹。時饑荒，鄉里及遠方客多有困乏，統為之飲食衰少。其姊仁愛有行，寡歸無子，見統甚哀之，數問其故。統曰：「士大夫糟糠不足，我何心獨飽!」姊曰：「誠如是，何不告我，而自苦若此？」乃自以私粟與統，又以告母，母亦賢之，遂使分施，由是顯名。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luotong:line061:m0001","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luotong:line061:m0028"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-wu057-luotong-2","subject_person_id":"7zi_5gs_mq2","object_person_id":"a9b_jua_1z9","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"為華歆小妻"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-057","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luotong","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-057-luotong","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luotong:line061","quote":"駱統字公緒，會稽烏傷人也。父俊，官至陳相。為袁術所害。統母改適，為華歆小妻，統時八歲，遂與親客歸會稽。其母送之，拜辭上車，面而不顧，其母泣涕於後。御者曰：「夫人猶在也。」統曰：「不欲增母思，故不顧耳。」事適母甚謹。時饑荒，鄉里及遠方客多有困乏，統為之飲食衰少。其姊仁愛有行，寡歸無子，見統甚哀之，數問其故。統曰：「士大夫糟糠不足，我何心獨飽!」姊曰：「誠如是，何不告我，而自苦若此？」乃自以私粟與統，又以告母，母亦賢之，遂使分施，由是顯名。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luotong:line061:m0033","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luotong:line061:m0028"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luotong:line061:m0028","surface":"母","start":28,"end":29,"kind":"person","person_id":"a9b_jua_1z9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luotong:line061","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luotong"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-wu057-luotong-1","subject_person_id":"7tc_utz_m7l","object_person_id":"a9b_jua_1z9","predicate":"mother","qual